From 793339daebd5b2e0c3ac7e5772382615addbfa2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mechanyaa-ai <mechanyaa@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:23:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cps2w: the vsavjw catalogue entry re-pointed to merged-m23
 (14z-192)

jtframe's .rom builder locates every zip member by CRC32 and by nothing else
(mra2rom.go:163-172, no name fallback), so the machine entry must name the
CRCs of the actual build or the MRA produces no .rom at all. Regenerated from
build/m3b_merged31/rompath/vsavjw.zip by tools/gen_vsavjw_xml.py in the
consuming tree; --check now reports the catalogue matches the build.

FOUR members moved, and they are the M23 delta exactly (the consuming tree's
build/agent192/m23/member_delta.txt and opset_delta.txt):
  vm3j.03d  09d90dbd -> 51a90934   program: #222's air-dash caller mask word
                                   (0x022AF4) and #223's two landing-sound
                                   mask words (0x003960, 0x003B38)
  vm3j.04d  b24a648b -> ef5acffb   program: #222's height-table row 0x10
                                   (0x0BE25A)
  vsw.33m   ee1148dd -> cd4c6970   group-C glyphs, the M22 -> M23 mark
  vsw.37m   11ff7862 -> 9a136ffb   likewise

No RTL, no cfg, no core change: doc/mame.xml only. cores/cps1, cores/cps2 and
cores/cps15 remain byte-untouched.
---
 doc/mame.xml | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/doc/mame.xml b/doc/mame.xml
index f90c50d3d..f31ce5b6e 100644
